    <description>
# Datadog CLI

A high-performance Datadog CLI tool written in Go that provides 67x faster startup than the Python version (3ms vs 200ms) and 67% less memory usage (10MB vs 30MB).

## Features

- **All 22 commands** with full Python parity
- **Zero dependencies** - single static binary
- **Fast performance** - 67x faster startup (3ms vs 200ms)
- **Low memory** - 67% less memory usage (10MB vs 30MB)
- **Context auto-detection** from git repositories
- **APM traces, logs, metrics, security** and more
- **Native Windows support** - works in cmd.exe and PowerShell

## Quick Start

After installation:

```powershell
# Set credentials
$env:DD_API_KEY = "your_api_key"
$env:DD_APP_KEY = "your_app_key"

# Test commands
dd context
dd health
dd apm
dd --help
```

## Commands

- `context` - Auto-detect service from git repository
- `apm` - Query APM traces and performance metrics
- `logs` - Search and analyze logs
- `metrics` - Query time-series metrics
- `security` - View security signals and events
- And 17 more commands!

## Documentation

Full documentation: https://github.com/yourusername/datadog-cli-go
